  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Cold-send question",
      "items": [
        "Where the host can ask, the refusal is a question: Send anyway goes through; Don't send, dismissed or no answer in 5 minutes holds the send (0 AI credits). If the model selection changed while the question was open, even Send anyway is held, with a note.",
        "Where it cannot ask (such as copilot -p) the refuse-once message appears, then the abort. Resend to pay.",
        "session.abort() is not awaited: awaiting it inside the hook deadlocks. Awaiting select() there did not, measured live 12 Oct 2026 in Copilot CLI 1.0.95 and VS Code.",
        "Asked once per cold episode (one file per session in refusals/, kept 7 days); later sends go through with the note. A queued prompt during a running turn is only priced."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the hook checks first",
      "items": [
        "Our own keep-warm ping returns early, but only while a ping is out, or in a process that does not hold the session lock. Typed ping text alone proves nothing.",
        "A ! escape and a built-in command return early: they never reach the model, so no turn is marked pending. The built-in list (LOCAL_COMMANDS) is unverified on a real host. Every other /name is guarded, including /compact and skill commands. A local command must be one line.",
        "A prompt marks a pending turn for 30 s (PROMPT_PENDING_MS) before any check runs. A second prompt that arrives during a check waits for it and shares its result.",
        "An unknown selection (Auto with no priced stand-in, a qualified provider or tier, a switch with no price) warns once per selection and reason. A cold send on a model with no known price warns once per cold episode: no price-based guard was possible."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Limits",
      "items": [
        "Early eviction: Luna was served cold at 29 of 30 min. The guard trusts cacheExpiresAt and stays quiet; the report counts a prefix break.",
        "The price is an estimate: last input plus answer, not your new message.",
        "With auto, the next prompt may use a different model than the one priced.",
        "copilot -p: Cache Clock has no reliable -p signal (HOST_IS_INTERACTIVE is always true, unverified on a real host). A built-in command name typed there may reach the model on a cold cache with no guard."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
